<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7638" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνατολικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>eastern,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμισφαίριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					2.3.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στοά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					20.9.7
				</span></i>
			, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάλασσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					346b
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				2.1.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Marin.
				<u>Procl.</u>
				36
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Marcian.
				<u>Peripl.</u>
				1.6
			</span></i>,al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνατολικοί, οἱ,</span>
			=
			<i>Orientales,</i> title of a <i>numerus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PFlor.
				278
			</span></i>V<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. χρόνος</span> time occupied <i>in
				rising,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gem.
				7.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Alm.</u>
				2.11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. φάσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ptol.
					<u>Tetr.</u>
					99
				</span></i>
			; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. σελήνη</span>
			<i>waxing moon,</i> Xenccr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				2.58.77
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				116
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνατολικόν, τό,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλύμενον</span>
			, of a flower <i>opening at sunrise,</i> Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.13
			</span></i>.</div>
